2 CONT Brychan Brycheiniog was the King of Garthmadryn, which was later called Brycheiniog or Brecknock after him.  He began his reign about 400, and died about 450. He married and had numerous issue. Many of his children had the reputat
2 CONC ion of great sanctity and preached the Gospel to the Britons who had relapsed into paganism.
