2 CONT Kings of Powys
2 CONT A Pre-Conquest Listing
2 CONT
2 CONT Kings of Powys
2 CONT
2 CONT Cadell Ddyrnllug (Gleaming-Hilt) fl. c.460
2 CONT Rhyddfedd Frych (the Freckled) fl. c.480
