1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wikipedia (last edited 3 July 2022) [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%81ed%C3%A1n_mac_Gabr%C3%A1in '''"Áedán mac Gabráin"'''] - An extensive webpage, multiply sourced.
