2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Generation Six
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. AIDAN (AIDANUS)6 (Gavran (Goranus)5, Domangart (Dongardus)4, Fergus the Great3, Ercc of DALRIADA2, Eochy (Eugenius) MUNREVAR1), son of (5) King Gavran (Goranus)5, was born before 574, and died between 606/8 and 608/10. [16] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Was crowned by his kinsman, St. Columba, on the island of Iona, 574; declared the independence of his kingdom at the council of Drumcreat in Ireland, 575; was defeated by Aethelfrith, King of Bernicia, and d. 606-608. 
2 CONT
2 CONT "574. Aidan, the son of gavran, reigned 34 years. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 608. The death of Aidan, the son of Gavran." 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child: + 7 i. KING EOCHY I (EUGENIUS I)7 BUIDE of Scots, b. before 608, d. in 629. 
2 CONT
