1 NOTE He ruled a kingdom in Scotland from 574 to 606. In 575, he and St. Columba attended the Conventions of Druim Cett in Northern Ireland.
1 NOTE He ruled a kingdom in Scotland from 574 to 606. In 575, he and St. Columba attended the Conventions of Druim Cett in Northern Ireland.
