2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Eochy I Buide (Eochaid, Eugenius the Yellow), d. c.650; a younger son who succeeded after his brother had been killed; King of Daliada 608-29; called King of the Picts; educated by St. Columba; succeeded by Connad Cerr, a cousi
2 CONC n, then by Donald I.
2 CONT
