2 CONT   His (poss.) 1(+)-Great Grandchildren:        Elisedd (Elisau Eliseg) ap GWYLOG   ;   Byordderch ap GWYLLAWG   ;   Brochfael (II) ap ELISEDD   ;   Sannan ap ELISEDD   ;   Bywyn ap BYORDDERCH
