2 CONT  Brenin Brycheiniog Idwallon ap Llywarch o Brycheiniog was the successor of Brenin Brycheiniog Llywarch ap Rigenew o Brycheiniog; King of Brycheiniog.2 Brenin Brycheiniog Idwallon ap Llywarch o Brycheiniog was born circa 560.1 He 
2 CONC was the son of Brenin Brycheiniog Llywarch ap Rigenew o Brycheiniog.1 King of Brycheiniog at the Brecon Beacons, Powys, Wales, circa 580.2 Brenin Brycheiniog Idwallon ap Llywarch o Brycheiniog was the predecessor of Brenin Brychei
2 CONC niog Rhiwallon ab Idwallon o Brycheiniog; King of Brycheiniog.2
