2 CONT      Also called Rimo.3 Tymyr verch Rhun o Gwynedd was born circa 528.3 She was the daughter of Rhun Hir ap Mælqwn, Brenin Gwynedd and Perfawr verch Rhun o Ebrauc.3 Tymyr verch Rhun o Gwynedd married King of Brittany Hoël II Fycha
2 CONC n ap Hoël de Bretagne, son of King of Brittany Hoël I Mawr ap Budic de Bretagne and Alma Pompea verch Riatham of Dumnonée, before 547.3
