2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Eanflæd (?) (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #173781, b. 626
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=26 Oct 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eanflæd (?) was born in 626. (2) She was the daughter of Edwin, King of Northumbria and Æthelberg (?). (1) She married Oswiu, King of Northumbria, son of Æthelfrith, King of Northumbria and Acha (?). (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Eanflæd (?) and Oswiu, King of Northumbria
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Osthryth (?)+ d. 697 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Ecgfrið, King of Northumbria b. 645, d. 20 May 685 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Ælfflæd (?) b. 654, d. bt 713 - 7141
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Ælfwine, Sub-king in Deira b. c 661, d. 679 (1)
