2 CONT    Brenin Brycheiniog Rhiwallon ab Idwallon o Brycheiniog was the successor of Brenin Brycheiniog Idwallon ap Llywarch o Brycheiniog; King of Brycheiniog.2 Brenin Brycheiniog Rhiwallon ab Idwallon o Brycheiniog was born circa 600.
2 CONC 1 He was the son of Brenin Brycheiniog Idwallon ap Llywarch o Brycheiniog.1 King of Brycheiniog at the Brecon Beacons, Powys, Wales, circa 620.2 Brenin Brycheiniog Rhiwallon ab Idwallon o Brycheiniog was the predecessor of Brenhin
2 CONC es Brycheiniog Ceindrech verch Rhiwallon o Brycheiniog; Heiress of Brycheiniog.2 After four generations of peaceful rule, Princess Ceindrych's father, King Rhiwallon ap Idwallon, became the last male-line descendant of Brychan to 
2 CONC rule in Brycheiniog.
