2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Eochaid married Spondana INGEN ENFIDAIG, daughter of Entfidich <of Britain> and FERCH BELI Princess of the Britons, before 697 5385. (Spondana INGEN ENFIDAIG was born about 675.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses/Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Spondana INGEN ENFIDAIG
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Eochaid MAC ECHDACH "The Venomous", king of Dál Riata (726-33)+
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Flann INGEN ECHACH Princess of Dál Riata+
2 CONT
2 CONT     * INGEN ECHACH Princess of Dál Riata+
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Eochaid"Crook Nose" ruled for about three years. He was killed about 679.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Eugene V, King of Dalriada, d. ca. 697, He became King of Dalraida, ca. 696 in Dungad, Scotland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Dongard, d. 673
2 CONT
2 CONT His Gaelic name was Eochaidh "Crook Nose".
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eugene VII, King of Dalriada, m. Spondan, d. 727, He became King of Dalriada, ca. 726 in Dungad, Scotland
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Domangart II Did not rule. He died in 673.
