2 CONT 9. -- Eochy II Rinnavel (Eochaid, Engenius Hooknose), killed 697; King of Dalriada from 694; is said to have given orders that the actions of the kings should be preserved in the records of the monasteries.  His wife's Pictish anc
2 CONC estors are recorded in Turton's "Plantagent Ancestries".
2 CONT
