2 CONC was the successor of Ifwr ap Cadwaladr, Brenin Gwynedd; King of Gwynedd.5 Idwal Iwrch ap Cadwaladr, Brenin Gwynedd married Afadda verch Alain de Bretagne, daughter of King of Brittany Alain II Hir ap Judicaël de Bretagne, before 6
2 CONC 90.4,6,2 King of Gwynedd at Wales before 712.5 Idwal Iwrch ap Cadwaladr, Brenin Gwynedd died in 712.4,2
