2 CONT 11.	Aed Find, or "the White", King of Dalriada, d. 778, aft. ruling 30 years.
1 NOTE King of Argyll and Dalriada.[FAVthomas.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Aed probably re-established independence from Pictish overlordship, andthe kingship of Dal Riata, when the Picts were defeated by theStrathclyde British in 750. He was on the offensive against the Picts by768, when he raided their
2 CONC  territory. Nothing else about his reign isrecorded. He was succeeded by his brother Fergus upon his death in 778.
1 NOTE Or Ethafind
