2 CONT Cadell ap Brochwel   
2 CONT
2 CONT Cadell was born in Powys, Wales.1   Cadell's father was King of Powys Brochfael ap Elisedd and his mother was <Unknown>.  His paternal grandparents were Elisedd ap Gwylog and <Unknown>.  He was an only child.  He died in 0808 in P
2 CONC owys, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Nest verch Cadell
2 CONT
2 CONT Nest was born in Powys, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Cyngen ap Cadell King of Powys
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Cadell ap Elisedd was a late 8th and early 9th century King of Powys (eastern Wales).
2 CONT
2 CONT See http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cadell_ap_Elisedd for more information.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Also called Cattell.3 Brenin Powys Cadell Powys ap Brochfael o Powys was son of Brochcmail.3 He was the successor of Brenin Powys Brochfael ab Elisedd o Powys; King of Powys.2 Brenin Powys Cadell Powys ap Brochfael o Powys was bor
2 CONC n circa 750.1 He was the son of Brenin Powys Brochfael ab Elisedd o Powys.1 King of Powys at Wales between 773 and 808.2 Brenin Powys Cadell Powys ap Brochfael o Powys died in 808. Died in battle against the Saxons?1 He was the pr
2 CONC edecessor of Brenin Powys Cyngen ap Cadell o Powys; King of Powys.
