2 CONT
2 CONT      Cynan Dindaethwy ap Rhodri Molwynog, Brenin Gwynedd was born circa 720? At Wales. He was the son of Rhodri Molwynog ab Idwal, Brenin Gwynedd and Margaret of Ireland.4,2,5,1 King of Gwynedd at Wales between 754 and 816.5 Cynan
2 CONC  Dindaethwy ap Rhodri Molwynog, Brenin Gwynedd married Matilda of Flint before 770. Cynan Dindaethwy ap Rhodri Molwynog, Brenin Gwynedd died in 816.5,6
