2 CONT Brenin Ddyfed Tewdos ap Rhein o Ddyfed was born circa 710.1 He was the successor of Brenin Ddyfed a Brycheiniog Rhain I ap Cadwgn Trydelig o Ddyfed; King of Dyfed. Brenin Ddyfed Tewdos ap Rhein o Ddyfed was the son of Brenin Ddyfe
2 CONC d a Brycheiniog Rhain I ap Cadwgn Trydelig o Ddyfed.1,2,3 King of Dyfed at South Wales after 730.5 Brenin Ddyfed Tewdos ap Rhein o Ddyfed was the predecessor of Brenin Ddyfed Maredudd ap Tewdws o Ddyfed; King of Dyfed.3,5
