2 CONT Bledrig Aillt o Ddyfed1,2,3
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 795
2 CONT
2 CONT      Bledrig Aillt o Ddyfed had a son who is listed in the Welsh triads as one of three kings who were sprung from villeins (serfs).2 Bledrig Aillt o Ddyfed also went by the name of Bledrig "the Villein". He was born circa 795. A 
2 CONC lowborn welshman.1 He married Tangwystl ferch Owain o Ddyfed, daughter of Brenin Ddyfed Owain ap Maredudd o Ddyfed, before 815.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Tangwystl ferch Owain o Ddyfed b. 794
2 CONT
