2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Regarding Rhodri's takeover over Ceredigion:
2 CONT
2 CONT This addition to his realm must have been made soon after 872, when Gwgon, the last of the kings of Ceredigion, met his death by drowning; Rhodri's marriage to Angharad, the dead king's sister, while it gave him no sort of legal c
2 CONC laim to the province, made it easy for him to intervene and invested his sons with rights there which would be more generally recognised.
