2 CONT      Brenin Ddyfed Hyfaidd o Ddyfed was the successor of Brenin Ddyfed Owain ap Maredudd o Ddyfed; King of Dyfed.6 Brenin Ddyfed Hyfaidd o Ddyfed was born circa 815.1 He was the son of Bledrig Aillt o Ddyfed and Tangwystl ferch Ow
2 CONC ain o Ddyfed.1,3,5 King of Dyfed at South Wales between 870 and 893.3,6 Brenin Ddyfed Hyfaidd o Ddyfed was oppressed by King Anarawd of Gwynedd and his brothers circa 890.1 He submitted to the overlordship of King Alfred the Great
2 CONC  of England rather than to Anarawd of Gwynedd before 893.7 He died in 893.1,2,3,8 He was the predecessor of Brenin Ddyfed Llywarch ap Hyfaidd o Ddyfed; King of Dyfed.6
