2 CONT ---------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT  Merfyn ap Rhodri   
2 CONT
2 CONT Merfyn was born about 0859.1   Merfyn's father was Rhodri (Mawr, The Great) ap Merfyn and his mother was Angharad verch Meurig.  His paternal grandparents were Merfyn (The Freckled) Frych ap Gwriad and Nest verch Cadell; his mater
2 CONC nal grandparents were Meurig ap Dyfnwallon and <Unknown>. He had eight brothers and two sisters, named Anarawd, Cadell, Aeddan, Tudwal, Meurig, Rhodri, Gwriad, Gwyddelig, Nest and Angharad.  He was the second oldest of the eleven 
2 CONC children.  He died in 0901.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Llywelyn ap Merfyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Llywelyn was born about 0880 in Llandeilo, Carmarthenshire, Wales.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Tryffin ap Merfyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Tryffin was born about 0887.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Iarddur ap Merfyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Iarddur was born about 0889.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Afandreg verch Merfyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Afandreg was born about 0891.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Merfyn ap Rhodri Mawr had the following children:
2 CONT
