1 NOTE PRINCE OF POWYS
1 NOTE 1  BIRT 2  DATE ABT. 859 2  PLAC of, Caer Seiont, Carnarven, Wales 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  DEAT 2  DATE 904 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001
