2 CONT Llywarch ap Hyfaidd
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Llywarch ap Hyfaidd (?-904) was the king of Dyfed until its conquest in 904/905 by Cadell ap Rhodri and his son, Hywel Dda. Kingship passed briefly to his brother, Rhodri, until rule was consolidated by Hywel. Hywel married Llywar
2 CONC ch's daughter, Elen, to legitimise his claim to the throne.
