2 CONT After the death of their father Owain, the tree brothers divided the kingdom.  Morgan outlived his brothers, and reunited the kingdom.  (Hence the nickname "Mawr," that is, "the Great.")
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Owain_ap_Hywel_(Glywysing)
