2 CONC ywel Dda married Angharad verch Llywelyn o Powys, daughter of Llywelyn ap Merfyn o Powys, before 938; 2nd cousins. (Dubious.).3 King of Deheubarth at Wales between 957 and 986.8 Brenin Deheubarth Owain ap Hywel Dda married N. N. (
2 CONC ?) before 960; His 2nd. Brenin Deheubarth Owain ap Hywel Dda died in 988 at age 75 years.6,2,7,3,9
