2 CONT
2 CONT  Angharad verch Llewelyn   
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad was born about 0918 in Llandeilo, Carmarthenshire, Wales.1   Angharad's father was Llywelyn ap Merfyn and her mother was <Unknown>.  Her paternal grandparents were Merfyn ap Rhodri and <Unknown>.  She was an only child.
2 CONT
2 CONT Owain ap Hywel & Angharad verch Llewelyn 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had five sons named Einion, Cadwallon, Maredydd, Llywarch and Iestyn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal Details
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT   Einion ap Owain Einion was born about 0933 in Deheubarth, Wales.2   He died in 0984 in Gwent, Monmouthshire, Wales.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Cadwallon ap Owain Cadwallon was born about 0935.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Maredydd ap Owain Maredydd was born about 0938 in Dynevor Castle, Carmenthenshire, Wales.1   He died in 0999.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Llywarch ap Owain Llywarch was born about 0940.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Iestyn ap Owain Iestyn was born about 0942.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Name: Angharad Verch Llywelyn 1  Sex: F  Birth: ABT 918 in Llandeilo, Carmarthenshire, Wales 1  Death: Deceased 1  Note:  Queen Of Powys[JohnFaye (8 Jun 05).FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen Of Powys http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=jcrow&id=I18418
2 CONT --------------------
