1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/6516/TABLES%20-%20EARLY%20SERIES_43.png?sequence=12&isAllowed=y (May 29, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
