2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Prawst Verch Elise
2 CONT
2 CONT born Abt 0940 Of, Gwynedd, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT Cynan Ap Seisyll born Abt 0984 Of, Wales died 1027
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Angharad Verch Maredydd Queen of Powys
2 CONT
