2 CONT '''Einion ap Owain,''' b. ca. 933 in Dynevor, Llandfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales, d. 984 in Gwent, Monmouthshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Father''': Owain ap Hywel, b. ca. 913 in Dynevor, Llandfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales, d. 988, He became King of Deheubarth, 954 in Deheubarth, Wales, He retired as King of Deheubarth, 986 in Wales 
2 CONT >'''Mother''': Angharad verch Llewellyn, b. ca. 918 in Llandeilo, Carmarthenshire, Wales 
2 CONT >'''Spouse''': Nest
2 CONT
2 CONT Edwin ap Einion, He became co-ruler of Deheubarth, 1005 in Deheubarth, Wales, He lost the kingdom to Llywelyn ap Seisyll of Gwynedd, 1018 in Deheubarth, Wales Cadell ap Einion, b. ca. 953 in Dynevor, Llandfeisant, Carmarthenshire,
