2 CONT
2 CONT Bleddyn ap Cynfyn born about 1025 Montgomeryshire, Wales died 1075 Miss verch Cynfyn born about 1024 Of Powys, Wales Rhiwallon ap Cynfyn born about 1025 Powys, Wales died 1070 (slain) Battle Mechain, Montgomeryshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Iwerydd verch Cynfyn born about 1024 Powys, Wales Nest verch Cynfyn born about 1027 Powys, Wales Gwerydd verch Cynfyn
2 CONT
2 CONT biographical and/or anecdotal:
2 CONT
2 CONT notes or source: LDS
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------- Angharad married first to Llywelyn ap Seisyll, Prince of Deheubarth (1018 - 1023) and they had a son: Gruffydd ap Llywelyn who inflicted a series of defeats on the English, and made alliances with the enemies 
2 CONC of King Edward the Confessor. Gruffydd fought a long campaign against rival kings to win overall control of Wales. By 1055, he had become master of Deheubarth and had expanded his rule to the lesser kingdoms of Morgannwg (Glamorga
2 CONC n) and Gwent. In 1063, Earl Harold Godwinsson (later Harold II) and his brother Tostig made a joint attack on Gwynedd. At the same time, Deheubarth rebelled against Gruffydd’s rule. Gruffydd fled and was murdered by his own men. G
2 CONC ruffydd married Ealdgyth, a daughter of Ælfgar, Earl of Mercia. Ealdgyth married second in circa 1064 to Harold Godwineson, the last Anglo-Saxon King of England. Ealdgyth and Gruffydd had a son: Maredudd ap Gruffydd who was exclud
2 CONC ed from the throne by his uncles Bleddyn ap Cynfyn and Rhywallon ap Cynfyn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad married second to Cynfyn ap Gwerystan of Powys, a lord in Powys about whom little is known. Angharad and Cynfyn had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhywallon ap Cynfyn Bleddyn ap Cynfyn a daughter who married Owain ap Edwin, Lord Tegaingl, and they had a daughter: Angharad who married Gruffydd ap Cynan, Prince of Gwynedd and/or King of North Wales from 1081 until his death in
2 CONC  1137. Click on Gruffydd ap Cynan for this line.
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://www.robertsewell.ca/powys.html <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> daughter of Maredudd ab Owain, wife of Llywelyn ap Seisyll, King of Gwynedd and of Deheubarth, with her first husband, and mother of Bleddyn ap Cynf
2 CONC yn with her second husband.
2 CONT --------------------
