2 CONT
2 CONT *Elystan "Glodrydd" ap Cuhelyn
2 CONT
2 CONT born 0933 Radnorshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died Cefndigoll, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT buried Trelystan, Gorddwr, Montgomeryshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Gwenllian verch Einion
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 0956 Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT son ap Elystan born about 0977 Buellt, Breconshire, Wales
2 CONT
