2 CONT Please see Peter Bartrum: Cydrych 1; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173378036053 & Gollwyn 1; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173392536824 [Based on lines that say that Cydrych married Nest, a 
2 CONC sister of Collwyn, Bartrum charts her as a daughter of Tangno ap Cadfael. Wolcott shows that the more likely line is Nest ferch Gwyn, a sister of Collwyn ap Gwyn ap Rhydderch. Although Bartrum charts Gruffudd and Cydifor as sons o
2 CONC f Nest, Wolcott has them as base sons, like Gwalchmai, with only Morda Frych being a son of Nest] (Steven Ferry, June 23, 2025.)
