2 CONT
2 CONT d) GWENLLIAN . m RHYS ap Gruffyd Prince of Deheubarth, son of GRUFFYD ap Rhys King of D|eheubarth & his wife Gwladus of Powys ([1132]-1197). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Madog had three illegitimate children by unknown mistresses:
2 CONT
2 CONT e) OWAIN Brogyntyn . m MARGARET, daughter of EINION ap Seisyll of Mathafarn & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
