1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/5378/malpas.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (September 24, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator) -- called "Miles," or "soldier," in the Welsh Genealogies
2 CONC .
