2 CONT Bishop and Earl 
2 CONT Benoît, born around 980, is the son of Budic , Count of Cornouaille in the last third of the 10th  century , died between 1008 and 1019 1 , Qu 1 . His mother, Budic's wife, may have descended from the lineage of Benoît, abbot of L
