2 CONT From Darrell Wolcott: " J.W.Y. Lloyd, in Powys Fadog vol ii, page 379 also mentions Jenkin Deweild (who he calls "of Holt") as the husband of Lleuci (1350) ferch Dafydd Llwyd (1320) ap Dafydd (1290) ap Thomas (1255) ap Rhys (1225)
