2 CONT Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL [Parents] 1 was born about 977 in Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died . He married Mrs-Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs-Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL 1 was born about 977 in Brittany, France. She died . She married Tewdwr "Mawr" Ap CADELL.
2 CONT
