2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	iii	 Gwyn Ap TEWDWR 1 was born about 999 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	iv	 Rhydderch Ap TEWDWR 1 was born about 1000 in Derllys, Gwarthaf, Carmarthenshire, Wales. He died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	v	 Nest Verch TEWDWR 1 was born about 1003 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. She died .
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	vi	 Elen Verch TEWDWR 1 was born about 1004 in Carmarthenshire, Wales. She died .
