1 NOTE Tedwr was the eldest con of Cadell and really rightful and lawful prince 
2 CONT of South Wales.  He was forced to flee into Britany in France, just 
2 CONT accross the English Channel, to which thousands of Welsh people had fled 
2 CONT to before from Britain, during the invasion of the Teutons.  He was 
2 CONT received kindly by his kinsmen, who were in control of that country.  He 
2 CONT marched with the Britians against their enemies, and was killed in battle. 
2 CONT  This was the Welsh Prince that the Tudor Kings of England came from.
