2 CONT
2 CONT 3.    NESTA, m. BARNARD de NEUFMARCHE, d. 1093, Lord of Brecon, son of GEOFFREY (son of THURCYTEL) by ADA, dau. of RICHARD de HUGELVILLE, and grandchild of RICHARD "the Good", by his dau. PAPIA. (CP I 22; VI 452-453).
2 CONT
