2 CONT Please see Darrell Wolcott: The 'Next Heir' of Morgan of Caerleon; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id214.html. (Steven Ferry, September 18, 2020.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caradog_ap_Gruffydd
2 CONT
2 CONT Caradog ap Gruffydd (died 1081) was a Prince of Gwent in south-east Wales who made repeated attempts to gain power over all of southern Wales by seizing the Kingdom of Deheubarth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Caradog was the grandson of Rhydderch ab Iestyn who had seized the throne of Deheubarth before his death in 1033. Caradog's father, Gruffydd ap Rhydderch also held sway in Deheubarth for a while before being eventually driven out 
2 CONC and killed by Gruffydd ap Llywelyn who eventually ruled most of Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.oxforddnb.com/view/printable/48555
2 CONT
2 CONT Iorwerth ab Owain (d. 1175x84), prince in Wales, lord of Caerleon, succeeded the king, his elder brother Morgan ab Owain, on Morgan's violent death in 1158. There is no indication that Iorwerth ever used the royal style, derived f
2 CONC rom their grandfather, Caradog ap Gruffudd (d. 1081), one-time dominant king of Gwlad Morgan and client of William I.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://welshleigh.org/genealogy/prichardancestry/prichardhistorical4.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT After the latter’s death in 1063, GRUFFUDD’s son CARADOG regained control in Monmouthshire. CARADOG had made his first appearance in 1065 on the eve of the Norman Conquest when he destroyed the new hunting lodge of earl Harold nea
2 CONC r Chepstow. In 1074 he also gained control in Glamorgan, and it was probably in that year that he made a grant to the church at Llandaff, describing himself as “king.” Over several years he attempted to seize Deheubarth, killing t
2 CONC he reigning princes Maredudd and Rhys, great nephews of CADELL ab EINION, but he never gained control, and in the battle of Mynydd Carn he was killed by RHYS ap TEWDWR, as we have seen in Welsh Princes 2.
2 CONT --------------------
