2 CONT
2 CONT Dafydd ap William ll ap Sir William was born about 1090.  His mother was Tangwystl, base born daughter of http://www.geni.com/people/Hugh-Lupus-d-Avranches-1st-Earl-of-Chester/6000000006146016186?through=6000000000538172995
2 CONT
2 CONT He married his first-cousin, Margaret ferch Ralph ap Sir William.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son was Wiliiam.
2 CONT
2 CONT Do not confuse with http://www.geni.com/people/Sir-David-le-Clerk-de-Malpas-Justice-of-Chester/6000000004868907755?through=6000000038923436682
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id152.html THE "MALPAS" FAMILY IN CHESHIRE] By Darrell Wolcott
2 CONT * Another marriage found in the Malpas pedigree material [10] says that David ap William le Belward married Margaret, daughter of Ralph of Malpas.  That this was an earlier Ralph of Malpas can be seen when we date the people in th
2 CONC at pedigree .... With this marriage, the line of Ralph became extinct and his one-third of Malpas passed to his son-in-law and nephew, David, and thence to his daughter's son, the earliest of the "William ap David ap William" men 
2 CONC in the family.
2 CONT **[10] Vis of Cheshire of 1590, 160 but see full discussion in the following Appendix
