2 CONT
2 CONT LDS
2 CONT
2 CONT research of S. E. Oman Salt Lake City
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Historical Events:  The First Crusade is the most documented of all the Crusades. Each Royal Court had its own historian, who told his Lord's story of conquest and adventure, emphasizing his Lord's actions and heroics. After the i
2 CONC nitial preaching of the Crusades in 1095, the actual movements of the Royal Armies did not start till 1096. In 1095, an unofficial Crusade was lead by a radical monk named Peter the Hermit. He preached the Crusades to the poor pea
2 CONC sant fanatics, and collected a small army to pilgrimage to the Holy Lands ahead of the main army. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More on this Website  >  
2 CONT
2 CONT • http://www.medievalcrusades.com/index.html
2 CONT
