2 CONT REFN: 6779
1 NOTE 1  NAME Susanna Verch /Gruffydd/ 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: A. Roots 176; Kreantzler 1123, 1409; Young.   K. has Susanna as wife of Madog and mother of Margaret. Unknow for sure if she was the mother of the other two children.
2 CONT    Roots: Susanna, daughter of Gryffyd ap Cynan.
2 CONT    Young: Susanna of Gwynedd.
2 CONT                    *******   Roots: Note error in Dict. of Welsh Biog. which shows Susanna as daughter of Owen Gryffydd. Correct father shown in Dictionary of National Biography.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES:  1.  Ancestral File gives her name as Susanna.  Other sources do not identify
2 CONT       her by name.
