2 CONT      Maurice fitz Gerald, Baron of Naas was born circa 1100.3 He was the son of Gerald fitz Walter and Nesta, Princess of Deheubarth.2 He married Alice de Montgomery, daughter of Arnolph de Montgomery and Lafracoth O'Brien.4 He di
2 CONC ed on 1 September 1176.3 He was buried at Grey Friars, Wexford, County Wexford, Ireland.4
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maurice fitz Gerald, Baron of Naas gained the title of Baron of Naas.5 He gained the title of Lord of Maynooth.5 He was also known as Maurice de Windsor.1 He emigrated to Ireland arriving on 1168.6
2 CONT
