2 CONT *Maurice "Invader of Ireland" Fitzgerald
2 CONT
2 CONT born 1100 Windsor, Berkshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT died 1 September 1177 Abbey Grey Friar, Welford, Berkshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT buried Abbey Grey Friar, Welford, Berkshire, England
