2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Nest verch Rhys
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1073 Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT died about 1163
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT Andaret FitzGerald de Windsor born about 1096 Carew Castle, Pembroke, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT David FitzGerald de Windsor born about 1098 Carew Castle, Pembroke, Wales died about 1176
2 CONT
2 CONT William FitzGerald de Windsor 1100 Carew Castle, Pembroke, Wales died about 1173
2 CONT
