2 CONT * Wife of Ralph ap Eynion; Griffith Baron of Malpas & Lord of Bromfield and Malor and Eynion de Tilston
2 CONT * Mother of Margaret Malpas (ferch Eynion); Ralph ap Eynion and Eynion de Tilston
2 CONT
