2 CONT spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Rhael verch Gronwy
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1111 Tegeingl, Flintshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Tangwystl verch Llywarch born about 1141 Menai, Anglesey, Wales
2 CONT # Einudd ap Llywarch born about 1145 Menai, Anglesey, Wales
2 CONT # Iorwerth ap Llywarch born about 1147 Menai, Anglesey, Wales
2 CONT # Cadwgon ap Llywarch born about 1151 Plas-coch, Llanddaniel-fab, Anglesey, Wales
2 CONT # Einion ap Llywarch born about 1153 Menai, Anglesey, Wales
2 CONT # Madog ap Llywarch born about 1149 Menai, Anglesey, Wales
