2 CONT From the above cited Wolcott paper: "In addition to the c. 1030 Rhys ap Tewdwr Mawr discussed earlier (as father of Gwladys Ddu), there was also a later Rhys ap Tewdwr in that same branch of the family.  Born c. 1120, he is the ma
2 CONC n who married Catryn (1135) ferch Iestyn (1105) ap Gwrgan (1075) [11] ap Ithel Fychan (1045) ap Ithel Ddu (1012).  Bartrum and others date her c. 1070 as a daughter of the c. 1045 Iestyn ap Gwrgan, married to the c. 1051 Rhys ap T
2 CONC ewdwr, but such a lady would be an unreasonable marriage match for that man.  We date her husband c. 1120, the Rhys ap Tewdwr who fathered sons Gwrgan [12] and Glewddwr." (Steve Ferry, March 3, 2023.)
