2 CONT
2 CONT Hywel ab Owain Gwynedd
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hywel_ab_Owain_Gwynedd
2 CONT
2 CONT Hywel ab Owain Gwynedd (died 1170) Wales Prince of Gwynedd in 1170, a Welsh poet and military leader. Hywel was the son of Owain Gwynedd, prince of Gwynedd, and an Irishwoman named Pyfog. In recognition of this, he was also known 
2 CONC as Hywel ap Gwyddeles (=Hywel son of the Irishwoman). Hywel was also known as the Poet Prince for his bardic skills.
