2 CONT Iefan ab Owain Gwynedd
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iefan_ab_Owain_Gwynedd
2 CONT
2 CONT Iefan ab Owain Gwynedd was a son of Owain Gwynedd (the king of Gwynedd between 1137-1170) and his second wife Cristina ferch Gronw. He had a daughter named Gwenllian.
2 CONT
