2 CONT
2 CONT Gwenwynwyn ab Owain Cyfeiliog (died c.1216) was the last major ruler of mid Wales before the completion of the Norman English invasion.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a grandson of Owain Gwynedd and ruled southern Powys from 1195, having taken control following the death of his father Owain Cyfeiliog.
2 CONT
