2 CONT '''Llywelyn "the Great" Ap Iowerth (Prince of Wales)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 1173 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 11 Apr 1240  
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:  Joan PLANTAGENET 18 Jun 1205  (b. c. 1188; d. 2 Feb 1237, Aber)  daughter of JOHN I "Lackland" (King of England) and Agatha De FERRERS  Notes: Others suggest her mother was Clemence, the wife of Henry Pinel.
