2 CONT 36. Edwin of Tegeingl [Note: PP.36 gives several contradictory accountsof Edwin's parentage, all from late manuscripts, so his parentage shouldbe regarded as unknown. The attempt of David H. Kelley (in "Edwin ofTegeingl", The Amer
2 CONC ican Genealogist 46 (1970), 75- 80) to identify himwith Edwin of Mercia is unconvincing.]
