2 CONT 40. Caradog. [Note: As father of Trahaern ap Caradog, his first name iscertain from his son's patronymic. As far as I have been able todetermine, none of Caradog's alleged ancestors (e.g., in ABT.2a,13,14) isa verifiably historica
2 CONC l individual.]
2 CONT
2 CONT 41. Unknown. [Note: The Welsh annals (AC and ByT) refer to Trahaern apCaradog as a cousin of Bleddyn ap Cynfyn (#24), which has led tospeculation that Trahaern's mother was perhaps a sister of Cynfyn apGwerystan (#48). However, al
2 CONC though we can be reasonably certain thatTrahaern and Bleddyn were cousins, this information is not enough to naildown the precise relationship.]
