2 CONT !RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT     1. The Dictionary of National Biography indicated Gwenllian, child #3 married William de Lacy and was the daughter of Llewelyn by Tanglwyst. Some of the less reliable sources indicate she was the daughter of Llewelyn by Joan, 
2 CONC Princess of England and that she married Robert de Lacy. See also notation on the family group record of the above Gwladys with her first husband, Reginald de Braose.
