2 CONC  see notes on that profile covering this line as charted by Wolcott. As to Gwen ferch Gruffudd, to be the mother of c. 1210 Adda ap Einion, she would need to be at c. 1195, with her father, Gruffudd ap Rhys Gwnle, being at c. 1165
2 CONC . That does not fit chronologically with Rhys. Either the connection to Rhys Gwnle is suspect, or the marriage is in error.] (Steven Ferry, September 20, 2023.)
