2 CONT * [1185] Red Book Exchequer, Part I, Knights fees, p. 60.  
2 CONT * [1186] Red Book Exchequer, Part I, Anno secundo regis Ricardi…scutagium Walliæ assisum, p. 72.  
2 CONT * [1187] Red Book Exchequer, Part I, Anno VI regis Ricardi, ad redemptionem eius, scutagium ad XXs, p. 91.  
2 CONT * [1188] Saint-Florent Saumur (Chartes normandes), 23, p. 692.  
