2 CONT * [1190] Crawley-Boevey, A. W. (ed.) (1887) The Cartulary and Historical Notes of the Cistercian Abbey of Flaxley otherwise called Dene Abbey in the county of Gloucester (Exeter) ("Flaxley (Dene)") 8, p. 134.  
2 CONT * [1191] CP I 22.  
2 CONT * [1192] Michel, F. (1840) Histoire des ducs de Normandie et des rois d´Angleterre (Paris), p. 112.  
2 CONT * [1193] Annales de Waverleia, p. 265.  
2 CONT * [1194] Luard, H. R. (ed.) (1864) Annales Monastici Vol. I, Annales de Margan, Annales de Theokesberia, Annales de Burton (London), Annales de Margan, p. 31.   
2 CONT * [1195] Michel (1840), p. 111.  
2 CONT * [1196] Dugdale Monasticon VI, Lanthony Abbey, Gloucestershire, II, Fundatorum progenies, p. 135.  
2 CONT * [1197] Flaxley (Dene) 8, p. 134.  
2 CONT * [1198] Annales de Waverleia, p. 265.  
2 CONT * [1199] Dugdale Monasticon VI, Lanthony Abbey, Gloucestershire, II, Fundatorum progenies, p. 134.  
2 CONT * [1200] Annales de Dunstaplia, p. 32.  
2 CONT * [1201] Michel (1840), pp. 112-5. 
