2 CONC raose; Giles de Braose, Bishop of Hereford; Reginald de Braose; Matilda de Braose; Margaret de Braose; Annora de Braose; Loretta de Braose; John de Braose; and Flandrina de Braose, Abbess of Godstowe.  He passed away on August 121
2 CONC 1 in Corbeil, France and is buried inwww.findagrave.com
