2 CONT !RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT     The above child #8, John, adopted the surname Knill, which name his descendants are known by.  The temple work done under the heirship of Robert Wimmer in 1939 claims as children for this couple--Flandrina, Roger, Philip, Thom
2 CONC as, Walter, Henry and Bernard; however, none of the above sources justify such children belinging to this group.
