2 CONT
2 CONT Norr, Vernon, M. (1958-1968). 'Some Early English Pedigrees: Combined from Most Available Sources'', [https://www.google.com/books/edition/Some_Early_English_Pedigrees/gajkAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=%22Sybil+de+Braose%22&dq=%22Sybi
2 CONC l+de+Braose%22&printsec=frontcover '''pp. 34-36.''']
2 CONT ----
2 CONT William de Braose [a], Lord of Abergavenny, b abt 1106, of Bramber, Sussex, England, and Briouze, Normandy, d 1192-1193, England. He md Bertha of Hereford abt Aug 1148, Herefordshire, England, daughter of Sir Miles Fitz Walter, Ea
2 CONC rl of Hereford, and Sibyl de Neufmarche.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William de Braose and Bertha Fitz Walter were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sybil de Braose b abt 1152, Bramber, Sussex, England, d aft 5 Feb 1227/28. She md Sir William de Ferrers, Earl of Derby, abt 1165, son of Sir Robert de Ferrieres, Earl of Derby, and Margaret Peverel.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sybil de Braose married William I, 3rd Earl of Derby, before 1168 in Sussex.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died after 5 February 1227.
2 CONT
2 CONT See "My Lines": ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/p389.htm#i6989 ) from Compiler: R. B. Stewart, Evans, GA
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sibyl de Braiose is Robert de Ferrers' wife per Burke,"Dormant Peerages",London,1883,p.196, who states that Robert's son William also had a wife named Sibyl (surname not given).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sibyl de Braose is Robert de Ferrers' wife per Burke,"Dormant Peerages",London,1883,p.196, who states that Robert's son William also had a wife named Sibyl (surname not given).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sybil de Braose was born on 1152 in Bramber, Sussex, England to William De Braose, 3rd Lord of Bramber and Bertha De Pitres De Braose.  Sybil married (1.) William I de Ferrers, 3rd Earl of Derby on 1161 in Sussex, England and had 
2 CONC 2 children:  William II de Ferrers, 4th Earl of Derby and Pernell de Ferrers.  Sybil married (2.) Adam de Port, Lord Bashing AFTER 1161. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sybil de Braose de Ferrers de Port is my 27th great grandmother.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sybil De Braose was born in Bramber, Sussex between 1146-1150 , the daughter of William de Braose, 3rd Lord of Bramber and Bertha de Gloucester
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William de Ferrers and they had the following children-
2 CONT
2 CONT * William II De Ferrers c1162
2 CONT * Agatha de Ferrers b: 1168-1172 in Chartley, Staffordshire, England concubine of John "Lackland, King of England
2 CONT * Robert de Ferrers b. 1169.
2 CONT * Petronilla De Ferrers b: Abt 1170 m. Hervey Bagot de Stafford
2 CONT * Millicent de Ferrers b.abt.1170. Married Roger de Mortimer.
2 CONT * Henry de Ferrers b: 1176
2 CONT
2 CONT Sybil was widowed in 1190 and then married Adam de Port.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sybil died c.1228
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born in Bramber, England on 1149 to William De Braose and Bertha De Gloucester. Sybil married William De Ferrers and had 8 children. Sybil married Walkelin De Ferrieres and had 6 children. Sybil married Adam De Port. She passed aw
2 CONC ay on 1228 in Ferrers Derby, Derbyshire, England.
2 CONT
