2 CONT >'''d'''. BEF 6 Jun 1235; bur. Reading, Eng.
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Married first''' Alice de WARKWORTH (-1225)
2 CONT >'''Children''':
2 CONT >>1. Lucy FITZPIERS (-1266) m. Sir William de ROS (1193-1264) 
2 CONT >>2. Herbert FITZPETER Sheriff of Hampshire (-1248) 
2 CONT >>3. Sir Reginald (Rynold) FitzPiers (-1286) m(1) Alice (-1264) 
2 CONT >'''Married second''' Isabel de FERRERS (1166-1252)
2 CONT >'''Married third''' Sibyl de DINHAM
2 CONT
