2 CONT '''M''', '''#'''368871 -- ''Last Edited=13 Jun 2009''-- '''Piers FitzHerbert''' gained the title of Lord of the Honour of Brecknock [England by writ].1  '''Child of Piers FitzHerbert''': Lucy FitzPiers+ 1
