2 CONT
2 CONT Cawley states that Olivier & his wife had four children...."[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Keats-Rohan states that Oliver died in 1150 leaving three sons, Geoffrey, Oliver and William. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ohier states that Olivier and Agnoree are said to have at least 8 sons, but he knows only two of them, Geoffroy and Olivier, the ancestors of the Dinan-nord lineage. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT #Geoffroy II, b. 1131, d. 1167, vicomte of Dinan-nord, m. Muriel de Poudouvre; they are said to have 6 children, but I know only 2 of them.[1]
2 CONT #Oliver or Olivier de Dinan, ancestor of the "Dinham" family in England.[1]
2 CONT #William
