2 CONT
2 CONT Gwrwared was followed by Gwilym, also called William in contemporary records, a "king's man" who held appointments in the royal service. In 1240-1 he was constable of the lordship of Cemais, in 1252 the King's seneschal over the l
2 CONC ands of Maelgwn, and in 1260 was constable of Cardigan. This was in keeping with the political attitudes of his kinsfolk, several of whom held public appointments of trust. His Royal Highness Prince Charles's 22-Great Grandfather.
2 CONC  Prime Minister Winston Churchill's 20-Great Grandfather. Lady Diana's 20-Great Grandfather. Prime Minister David Cameron's 21-Great Grandfather. Major General Pierpont Hamilton's 21-Great Grandfather. John `Osawatomie' Brown's 18
2 CONC -Great Grandfather. President Stephen Grover Cleveland's(22nd US President) 18-Great Grandfather.
