2 CONT >"lorwerth ab Einion, Lord of Sonlli and Eyton Uchaf, who married Tibot, daughter and heir of Sir Robert Harawyt, or Hammond de Pulford, Knt, Lord of Pwllffordd, or Pulford, by Elizabeth his wife, daughter of Sir Rowley Corbet, of
2 CONC  Lee, Knt., and Elizabeth his wife, '''daughter of Cynwrig Sais''' (sable, a cross argent for De Pulford); by whom he had issue four sons ; 1, Gruffydd ab lorwerth, of whom presently; 2, Ednyved, or Ednowain ab lorwerth ; 3, Einio
2 CONC n ab lorwerth, who married the daughter of Ednyfed Goch, of Gnottyn ab Goronwy ab Owain, by whom he had an only daughter and heiress, Gwenllian ux Howel Maelor ab leuaf Ddu ab leuaf ab Madog ab Bledrws, twelfth son of Cynwrig ab R
2 CONC hivvallawn ; and 4, Madog ab lorwert
