2 CONT      Also called of Gwynedd. Margred verch Llewelyn was born circa 1207 at Caernarvonshire, Wales.1 She was the daughter of Llewelyn Ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales and Joan Plantagenet.1,2,3 Margred verch Llewelyn married John
2 CONC  Tadody de Braose, Lord of Bramber and Gower, son of William de Braose and Maud de Clare, in 1219; Her 1st. 1st cousins, 2x removed.1,2,3 Margred verch Llewelyn married Walter, 3rd Lord Clifford, son of Walter, 2nd Lord Clifford a
2 CONC nd Agnes de Cundi, circa 1234; Her 2nd. Margred verch Llewelyn died after 1263 at Clifford Castle, Herefordshire, England.1
2 CONT
