1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Peter Bartrum: Gruffudd Chwith; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173393042830 & Gwyn ap Gruffudd 7; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173392786827 [NOTE: Bartrum charts G
2 CONC ruffudd Chwith as descending from Elystan Glodrydd, but he is nowhere located in the Elystan Glodrydd charts. His descendants listed after son Dafydd are more properly charted as deriving from Rhys Fychan ap Einion (Rhys Fychan ab
2 CONC  Einion). Please see notes on that profile covering this line as charted by Wolcott. As to Gwen ferch Gruffudd, to be the mother of c. 1210 Adda ap Einion, she would need to be at c. 1195, with her father, Gruffudd ap Rhys Gwnle, 
2 CONC being at c. 1165. That does not fit chronologically with Rhys. Either the connection to Rhys Gwnle is suspect, or the marriage is in error.] (Steven Ferry, September 20, 2023.)
