1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Mathilda de Braose=
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of '''William III de Braose and Matilde de Saint-Valery'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Married '''Gruffydd ap Rhys, King of Deheubarth'''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3.htm#_Toc21417713
2 CONT
2 CONT '''MATILDA de Briouse''' (-21 Dec 1209, bur Strata Florida).  Her parentage is confirmed by the which Annales Cambriæ name "Griffinus…" and "Willielmoque de Breusa socero suo"[851].  The Chronicle of the Princes of Wales records t
2 CONC he death in 1209 "on the feast of St Thomas the Martyr...at Llanbadarn the Great" of “Mahalt de Bruse, the mother of the sons of Gruffudd son of Rhys” and her burial “with her husband at Strata Florida”[852].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m (1189) GRUFFYDD ap Rhys, son of RHYS ap Gruffydd King of Deheubarth & his wife Gwenllian of Powys (-[Jul/Aug] 1201, bur Strata Florida).  He succeeded his father in 1197 as King of Deheubarth. See http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands
2 CONC /WALES.htm#Gruffydddied1201
2 CONT
2 CONT Gruffydd & his wife had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT a)        ''' RHYS Ieuanc''' (-1222). 
2 CONT b)       '''  OWAIN''' (-1235, bur Strata Florida).  The Chronicle of the Princes of Wales records that "young Maelgwn son of Maelgwn son of Rhys burned Aberteivi to the gate of the castle…and from thence he came to Owain son of G
2 CONC ruffudd son of the lord Rhys his cousin…to fight against the castle" in 1231[465].  The Chronicle of the Princes of Wales records that "Owain son of Gruffudd son of the lord Rhys…died at Strata Florida on the Wednesday after the o
2 CONC ctave of the Epiphany and was buried with Rhys, son of the lord Rhys, his brother in the chapter house of the monks" in 1235[466].  m ---.  The name of Owain´s wife is not known.  Owain & his wife had one child:
2 CONT >i)          MAREDUDD (-Llanbadarn Mar 1265, bur Strata Florida).  The Chronicle of the Princes of Wales records that "Maredudd son of Owain son of Gruffudd son of the lord Rhys" died in Mar 1264 "at Llanbardarn the Great and was 
2 CONC buried in the chapter house of the monks of Strata Florida"[467]
2 CONT --------------------
