2 CONT     There appears to be considerable conflict between the record sources above quoted relative to the parentage of the above Reginald; however, "The Complete Peerage", v. 1, p. 22, which is usually very accurate, indicates he is t
2 CONC he son ofWilliam de Braose by wife Matilda de St. Valery, which is also further amplifiedand explained in "The Genealogist", Eng. Pub. AF, os, v. 5, p. 147.
