2 CONT * http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~jamesdow/s092/f502189.htm
2 CONT * http://www.genpc.com/gen/files/d0023/f0000002.html#I1424 http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/FERRERS.htm 
2 CONT * http://thepeerage.com/p40720.htm#i407195
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note:''' ''The single cited source and the above URLs do contain no primary source RE her parentage.''
2 CONT +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
2 CONT '''Joan Plantagenet''' 
2 CONT '''Born''': ABT 1188
2 CONT '''Died''': 2 Feb 1237, Aber
2 CONT '''Notes''':  Others suggest her mother was Clemence, the wife of Henry Pinel.
2 CONT '''Father''':  John I "Lackland" (King of England)
2 CONT '''Mother''':  Agatha de Ferrers 
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Married 1''':  Llywelyn "the Great" ap Iowertg (Prince of Wales) (b. 1173 - d. 11 Apr 1240);  m. 18 Jun 1205
2 CONT >Children:
2 CONT >1.  Dafydd Ap LLYWELYN (Prince of Gwynedd) (m. Isabella De Braose)
2 CONT >2.  Ellen Verch LLYWELYN
2 CONT >3.  Angharad Verch LLYWELYN
2 CONT >4.  Margaret Verch LLYWELYN (m.1 John De Braose - m.2 Walter Clifford)
2 CONT
2 CONT >>'''Married 2''': Geoffrey de NEVILLE AFT 1208
2 CONT >>5. John de NEVILLE
2 CONT >>6. Geoffrey de NEVILLE (Sir)
2 CONT >>7. Agnes de NEVILLE
2 CONT _________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN of John and Agatha included: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan, Princess of England was born about 1188 in Of London, Middlesex, England. She died in Feb 1237 in Aberconwy, Arllechwedd Isaf, Caernarvonshire, Wales.  She was buried in Llan-Faes, Dindaethwy, Anglesey, Wales. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married #1.  King Llewelyn Fawr "The Great" ap Iorwerth after 16 Apr 1205 in England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >They had the following children: 
2 CONT >'''F'''  i  Gwladys "Ddu" verch Llewelyn 
2 CONT >'''F'''  ii  Elen (Helen) verch Llewelyn 1 was born about 1206 in Of Caernarvonshire, Wales. She died before 24 Oct 1253 in Of Chester, Cheshire, England.  
2 CONT >'''F'''  iii  Gwenllian "Las" verch Llywelyn 1 was born about 1207 in Of Caernarvonshire, Wales. She died .  
2 CONT >'''M'''  iv  Prince Dafydd (David) ap Llywelyn 
2 CONT >'''F'''  v   Margred (Margaret) (Marared) verch Llywelyn 
2 CONT >'''F'''  vi  Angharad verch Llywelyn 1 was born about 1212 in Of Caernarvonshire, Wales. She died in infancy.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Married #2.  Braose, William "Black William" de (Breos) 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born in England on 1166 to William De Ferrers and Sybil De Braose. Agatha married John and had a child. She passed away on 30 Mar 1236 in Aberconway, Caernarvonshire, Wales.
