2 CONT Pernell de Ferrers was born on 1169 in England to William I de Ferrers, 3rd Earl of Derby and Sybil de Braose de Ferrers.  Pernell married Henry de Stafford and had a child:  Robert de Stafford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pernell de Ferrers de Stafford is my 26th great grandmother.
