2 CONT >''Last Edited=13 Jun 2009''
2 CONT >Lucy FitzPiers is the daughter of Piers FitzHerbert.2 She married Sir William de Ros, son of Robert de Ros, 1st Lord Ros of Helmsley and Isabella (?).1
2 CONT '''Children of Lucy FitzPiers and Sir William de Ros'''
2 CONT * Sir Robert de Ros+ d. 17 Mar 12852
2 CONT * Sir William de Ros+ d. 28 May 13101
2 CONT * Piers Ros 2
2 CONT
