2 CONT * GILBERT, his heir, compelled to m Lady Hawyse Roumare dau of William de Roumare, Earl of Lincoln,                 became jure uxoris Earl of Lincoln   
2 CONT * ROBERT, succeeded his brother as heir to property but not the title  
2 CONT * Geffery 
2 CONT * ALICE de GANT m ROGER de MOWBRAY (see under Mowbrays for descendants) 
2 CONT * AGNES, m WILLIAM II de MOHUN, Earl of Somerset, (see under Mohun for descendants) 
2 CONT *  dau, m WILLIAM, ancestor of the Barons WELLES (see under Welles for descendants) 
