1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Robert "Lord of Folkingham" de Gant formerly Gaunt aka of Gaunt, de Gand, de Ganth'''.  Born about 1122 in Folkingham, Lincolnshire, England. Son of Walter (Gant) de Gant and Matilda (Bretagne) de Gaunt. Brother
2 CONC  of William (Lindsay) de Lindsay [half], Agnes (Gand) de Mohun, Alice (Gand) de Mowbray, Gilbert (Gant) Gaunt and Maud (Gant) Welles Husband of Alice (Paynell) Paganel — married  Husband of Gunnora (Aubigny) de Gaunt — married abo
2 CONC ut 1179.  Father of Avice (Gant) de Gaunt and Gilbert (Gand) Gaunt.
2 CONT ----
