2 CONT # ''How the Lindsays came to Scotland''. Lindsay History. by Lindsay International (2020). Accessed April 2020.
2 CONT # [1] THE FLEMISH, by Dean Amory, Lulu.com, Mar 3, 2014. 314  pages [https://books.google.com/books?id=IqKCBgAAQBAJ&pg=PA76&lpg=PA76&dq=Walter+de+Ghent+Now+de+Lindsay&source=bl&ots=0HtVx2Cu4P&sig=ACfU3U1tU0k9MWEAjgFvK6_TnAhlSt5JOg
2 CONC &hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiRk6yQqdzoAhVWbc0KHT71AuQQ6AEwAnoECAkQKA#v=onepage&q=Walter%20de%20Ghent%20Now%20de%20Lindsay&f=false pp.75-76].
2 CONT # Lord Lindsay, "Lives of the Lindsays: A Memoir of the Houses of Crawford and Balcarres", vols. 1 – 3. (John Murray, London, Second Edition 1858)
