2 CONC ealogy of the Gant family records that “''Gilbertum''”, son of “''Gilbertus''”, died “''1274 Non Jan apud Falkingham''” and was buried “''apud Bridlington''”[977].  Inquisitions after a writ dated 26 Jan "2 Edw I" following the de
