2 CONT >'''Agnes de Gaunt''' (b. 1118, d. 1155)
2 CONT >Born: Folkingham, Lincolnshire, England
2 CONT >Agnes De Gaunt (daughter of Walter De Gaunt and Matilda De Brittany)197 was born 1118 in Folkingham, Lincolnshire, England, and died 1155 in Somersetshire, England. She married William II De Mohun, son of >William I De Mohun and 
2 CONC Adeliz De Mohun.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT >'''Adeliz De Mohun (b. 1060)'''
2 CONT >Adeliz De Mohun was born 1060 in Dunster, Somersetshire, England. She married William I De Mohun.
2 CONT >'''Children of Adeliz De Mohun and William I De Mohun are:''' William II De Mohun, b. 1100, Dunster, Somerset, England245, d. 1155, Dunster Castle, Somersetshire, England.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''She is a direct descendant of Charlemagne.'''
2 CONT This is her lineage:
2 CONT 1 Charlemagne
2 CONT 2 Louis I, The Pious
2 CONT 3 Charles II "the Bald", Western Emperor
2 CONT 4 Louis II the Stammerer, king of the West Franks
2 CONT 5 Ermentrude de France
2 CONT 6 Cunigunda, countess of Trèves & Ardennes
2 CONT 7 Siegfried I, count of Luxembourg
2 CONT 8 Frederick I, count of Moselgau
2 CONT 9 Gisèle de Luxemburg
2 CONT 10 Gislebert dit “Le Grand” de Gant (Gaunt), baron de Folkingham, seigneur de Hunmanby
2 CONT 11 Walter van Gent, lord of Folkingham (aka Walter de Lindsey)
2 CONT 12 Agnes de Gant
2 CONT ----
