2 CONT In the "Kings of England" (Eng. 176), it is claimed Constance died without issue (Child #2), however, "History of Yorkshire" (Yorks 22) shows her as the mother of the "la Zouch" line by marriage to Alan la Zouch, Viscount of Rohan
2 CONC . Thhe later seems to have beren the result of subsequent research and has therefore been accepted for this compilation
2 CONT
2 CONT Research needs to be done to verify this is the right connection in the pedegree line.
2 CONT From Genealogical Library book "House of Adam".
