2 CONT
2 CONT d JOAN The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified m (1253 or before) as his first wife, PIERS [I] Corbet, son of THOMAS Corbet of Caus, Shropshire & his wife Isabel de Dunstanville de 
2 CONC Vautort (-1300 before 10 Aug) He was summoned to Parliament in 1295 whereby he is held to have become Lord Corbet
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3.htm#PiersCorbetdied1300
2 CONT
