2 CONT From charting by Darrell Wolcott, Center for the Study of Ancient Wales. Bartrum's Bleddyn ap Cynfyn 54; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173378121032 makes Efa the daughter of Ieuan Gethin, but he is missing a ge
