0 @N6000000002315775411@ NOTE Was crowned by his kinsman, St. Columba, on the island of Iona, ; declared the independence of his kingdom at the council of Drumcreat in Ireland, ; was defeated by Aethelfrith, King of Bernicia, and d. 606-608. " Aidan, the son o
1 CONC f gavran, reigned 34 years.  The death of Aidan, the son of Gavran." 
