0 @N6000000002187590988@ NOTE Eochaid I of Dalriada
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Eochaid I Buide (Scottish Gaelic: Eochaid mac Aeden) was king of Dál Riada from 608 until 629. He was the younger son of King Aedan and succeeded his father upon the death of his elder brothers. "Buide" refers to the color yellow,
1 CONC  as in the color of his hair. He died in 629 and was succeeded by Connad.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Aedan King of Dál Riada
1 CONT 608-629 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Connad 
