0 @N6000000002187590930@ NOTE Eochaid II of Dalriada
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT Eochaid II of Dalriada the Crook-Nose (Scottish Gaelic: Eochaid mac Domangart; English: Eugene) (d. ca. 697) was king of Dál Riada in about 697. He was the son of Domangart II, king of Dál Riad and father of Eochaid III.
1 CONT
1 CONT
