1 CONT
1 CONT 13. CYNAN (son of No. 12). As far as is known his rule did not extend beyond the commote of
1 CONT           Tindaethwy. Soon after A.D. 800 he attacked his brother Hywel to gain possession of Anglesey, but
1 CONT           was defeated. He died in 816.13. CYNAN (son of No. 12). As far as is known his rule did not extend beyond the commote of
1 CONT           Tindaethwy. Soon after A.D. 800 he attacked his brother Hywel to gain possession of Anglesey, but
1 CONT           was defeated. He died in 816.
