0 @N6000000003949663060@ NOTE He was apparently of low birth, although I don't know who his parents were. He would have been born around 790 and probably in Dyfed. I know nothing about his youth at all. All I can guess is that he
1 CONT must have done well for himself, in that he married Tangwystl of the Milesian dynasty, a daughter of King Owain of Dyfed. Tangwystl seems to have been the only daughter of the King and thus the ancient Milesian dynasty came to an 
1 CONC end when  she inherited the title from her father. The honours thus went to Bleiddig and his descendants. His was given the epithet "the Villain", why this is I haven't been able to find out, but it may be because he was considere
1 CONC d a stealer of the throne of Dyfed, by being too lowly born, alternately the title could be from the older meaning of the word, i.e. a serf or peasant, which would tie in with what we know of his background
