0 @N6000000003949663077@ NOTE wain, assumed the kingship of Dyfed after his elder brother's (Rhein ap Maredudd, d. 808) son Triffyn ap Rhein d. c. 810, without issue. Owain was the last male descendant of Aed Brosc, and he only ruled about 1 year. His daughter
