1 CONT
1 CONT Hywel Dda (dda = the Good)
1 CONT King of All Wales
1 CONT succeeded as King of Dyfed jure uxoris ca.904. King of Seiswyllwg 909,king of Gwynedd 942. He did homage to King Edward the Elder in 918 andto King Athelstan in 926. Went on a pilgrimage to Rome in 928, was theonly Welsh ruler to 
