0 @N6000000001744977329@ NOTE Claimed lordship of Gwynedd in 1170 and won it in 1173 by his support for Henry II of England when the English barons rebelled against the king that year. Then married Henry's illegitimate sister, Emma. Was driven out of Wales in 
1 CONC 1194 by supporters of Llewelyn ap Iorwerth (his brother or nephew). Source: Elizabeth Hallam, The Plantagenet Encyclopedia (NY: Crescent Books, 1996) 58.
