0 @N6000000003949949247@ NOTE I originally had Iago's father Gruffudd ap Eidde, b. 972, which was obviously an error, as pointed out in an e-mail from Wayne R. Davy. I have added a century to each of Iago's ancestor's estimated birth year. This makes Elise, th
1 CONC e ultimate ancestor, b. c1000, whereas he was orginally b. c900. This seems correct by my pedigree, but others have Elise b. c900. Since the line does not tie into other lines at this point, I don't see how other people (as I myse
1 CONC lf originally did) estimated Elise's birth year at 900, when 1000 seems more reasonable.   (per Jim Weber)
