0 @N6000000004533944874@ NOTE Andrew, World Connect db=andwai, shows William Ramsay as son of Conanby Ermengarde of Anjou.  However chronology would indicate thatWilliam was the younger son of Conan's son Eudes by Orguen, shown on achart in CP. This William is
1 CONC  the only William shown as a descendant ofConan Duke of Brittany.
