1 CONT Note: !PlantagEncy, 36: Lord of Brecon, ambitious lesser baron
1 CONT      who rose in John's service. Captured John's nephew Arthur of
1 CONT      Brittany at Mirebeau in 1202; rewrded with many lands &
1 CONT      offices in South Wales, inc. sheriff of Hertfords. (1206). To curb
1 CONT      his power John tried to take his sons hostage in 1208; William
