0 @N6000000003051162282@ NOTE One of the premiere Norman warriors, he was known to the Welsh as "The Ogre of Abergavenny".
1 CONT Fought many battles with King Richard and was with him at Chalus in 1199 where the King died.
1 CONT Captured and imprisoned Arthur, Count of Brittany, for King John.
