0 @N6000000002303571972@ NOTE That the Zouches branched from the Earls of Brittany is admitted by all genealogists, but they do not coincide in the exact line of descent. William la Zusche to the monks of Swavesey, in Cambridgeshire, the grants made by his anc
1 CONC estors to the abbey St. Segius and Bacchus, in Anjou (to which the priory of Swavesey was a cell), calls Roger la Zusche, his father, and Alan la Zusche, his grandfather. This William died in the first year of the reign of King Jo
1 CONC hn, and was succeeded by his brother, Roger. 
1 CONT Ref: Burke, pp. 598-599
