0 @N6000000000604974285@ NOTE Helen (?)1 (F) d. after February 1294/95, #127280d. 1240|p10791.htm#i107904||||Iorwerth D. (?)||p10260.htm#i102595||||||||||');"Pedigree <JavaScript:pup('Helen (?)|d. a Feb 1294/95|p12728.htm> Last Edited=9 Nov 2004
1 CONT Helen (?) was the daughter of Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales <p10791.htm>.1 She married Malcolm MacDuff, 5th Earl of Fife <p12729.htm> before 1266.1 She married Donald, 6th Earl of Mar <p10916.htm>, son of William, 5t
1 CONC h Earl of Mar <p460.htm> and Muriel (?) <p2587.htm>, after 1266.1 She died after February 1294/95.1
1 CONT Children of Helen (?) and Donald, 6th Earl of Mar <p10916.htm>:
1 CONT Duncan (?) <p2587.htm> Alexander (?) <p2587.htm> Isabella, Lady of Mar <p10209.htm>+ d. b 1302 Gartnait, 7th Earl of Mar <p10788.htm>+ d. b Sep 1305 Margaret (?) <p10786.htm>+ b. b 1268
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S6 <s1.htm>] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant,
1 CONC  Extinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VIII, page 403. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
